Not a medical device

Qython is a study and documentation aid. It is not a medical device, has not
been reviewed by ANVISA, the FDA or any other regulator, and must not be used
as the sole basis for any clinical decision. Language-model output contains
errors, including confident and plausible ones; verify every clinical
statement against primary sources.

